      <h3 id="properties-navigator-and-helper" class="group scroll-mt-20">Properties, Navigator, and Helper<a href="#properties-navigator-and-helper" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h3>
